    "content": "لاحظ كيف اختزل سمير الكسر $\\dfrac{84}{48}$: $\\dfrac{84}{48} = \\dfrac{84 \\div 4}{48 \\div 4} = \\dfrac{21}{12} = \\dfrac{21 \\div 3}{12 \\div 3} = \\dfrac{7}{4}$."
